1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,240
For I am persuaded that

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,240
neither death, nor life,

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,660
nor angels, nor principalities,

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:12,100
nor things present, nor things to come, nor powers,

5
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,360
nor height, nor depth,

6
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,340
nor any other created thing

7
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,100
will be able to separate us

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,180
from God’s love

9
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,840
which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.
